{"ts":"2026-08-04T09:18:04.437Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"ecc9554d11d78abfd35454a3","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-04T09:18:04.437Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-04T09:18:04.437Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Fresh audit evidence 2026-08-04: pnpm lint reached the SDK import-cost gate after ESLint, jscpd, static quality, package boundary, package-SDK parity, token budgets, context calibration, gate registry, and SDK surface checks passed. The first fresh-process sample failed governance 536ms>248ms, merge 258ms>195ms, and query 214ms>172ms. An immediate isolated rerun failed on bare node 117ms>95ms instead, demonstrating sample-to-sample and target-to-target instability rather than a stable entrypoint regression. The gate remains a real quality failure until its measurement contract is made robust."}]}],"before_hash":"ed4e55f4104040f8fe35ae4a8cae4448af1d82a6c7e434bc580a028b2080605c","after_hash":"00ed9cb8086d2e99865d177d82ecde0bcc39e417946e8a07934a564321cd84d2"}
{"ts":"2026-08-05T18:27:07.798Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"ac5e22eebf92a6af581282d9","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"1","source":"environment"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.222","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-08-05T18:27:07.798Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Fresh non-determinism sample, 2026-08-05, on an unchanged src tree (this session's diff touches only scripts/, tests/ and tracker data — zero files under src/). Three consecutive --check runs, back to back, warm cache:\n\n  run 1: Verified SDK entrypoint import costs (10 entrypoints)\n  run 2: FAILED — ./sdk/authoring 140ms > 133ms, ./sdk/query 203ms > 172ms\n  run 3: Verified SDK entrypoint import costs (10 entrypoints)\n\nA prior run in the same session had failed on a different entrypoint again (./sdk 375ms > 367ms). So the gate does not merely false-fail on a cold filesystem cache as the title states — it false-fails on a warm one too, and the entrypoint that trips is not stable between runs. Two of five failures observed today were within 6 percent of the budget.\n\nThat widens the fix: a single-shot fresh-process sample cannot separate an 8ms regression from 8ms of scheduler noise at any cache temperature, so the remedy has to be a sampling and admission policy (best-of-N, or a distribution with a declared confidence), not a warm-up."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-05T18:27:07.798Z"}],"before_hash":"00ed9cb8086d2e99865d177d82ecde0bcc39e417946e8a07934a564321cd84d2","after_hash":"38a41ac87e3c54e5d19b95000eb08c03d9cac991bc1d44b339a63617f8a60472","message":"Warm-cache non-determinism sample"}
